{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026secweSMaoW1793707011.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>世界互聯網大會烏鎮峰會，在浙江烏鎮舉行。總理李強致詞時稱，中國堅持開門搞創新，反對「數字鐵幕」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.INTERNET-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pCQJGPTEhQ1793707019.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>李強稱互聯網發展須促進人的全面發展</strong></p><p></p><p>李強表示：「世界互聯網大會已經連續舉辦了13年，互聯網發展的最終目的，必須是促進人的全面發展，不能讓技術加劇人類發展的分化，必須堅持人的主導性，讓機器成為人類的可信工具。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.INTERNET-2000-1_CLEAN_20261103_200949_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WBX4KlCq5L1793709523.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>中國堅持開門搞創新</strong></p><p></p><p>他又指：「中國將堅持開門搞創新，堅持促進技術轉移和知識共享。要堅持可信可控，築牢數字安全屏障，中國將始終尊重，各國網絡安全合理關切，同舟共濟應對安全挑戰，反對構築『數字鐵幕』，並支持全球南方國家，建設數字基礎設施，提升數字技術能力。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:29.752574+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.680656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:29.269991+00:00","content_hash":"d6992aed3dc006a929b45a73befa860b8683f404ef2ad6eaf839fc1d7f7cf479","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:29.752574+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}